### Overview  
This issue outlines the development of the Phase 1 of the Mobile App MVP focusing on Authentication and Shift Management functionalities.  

### Features Checklist  
- [ ] User authentication (login, registration, logout)  
- [ ] Shift creation and management  
- [ ] User roles (admin, staff)  
- [ ] Notifications for shift changes  
- [ ] Integration with backend APIs  

### Acceptance Criteria  
1. Users must be able to register and login.  
2. Users can create, view, update, and delete shifts.  
3. Admin users can manage shifts for all staff.  
4. System sends notifications for shift changes to affected users.  

### Estimated Timeline  
- Start Date: 2026-03-20  
- End Date: 2026-05-20  

### Dependencies  
- Backend API development for authentication  
- Database setup for user and shift management  

